sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Cashier
    participant UI as CreateOrderPage
    participant OC as OrderController
    participant OS as OrderService
    participant IR as InventoryRepository
    participant CR as CustomerRepository
    participant OR as OrderRepository
    C->>UI: search products, build cart, pick customer and payment type
    UI->>OC: POST /api/orders with JWT
    OC->>OS: createOrder(OrderDTO)
    OS->>OS: get cashier and branch from JWT
    OS->>CR: find customer
    loop each item
        OS->>IR: check and reduce branch stock
    end
    OS->>OS: calculate total
    OS->>OR: save order and items
    OS-->>OC: OrderDTO (OrderMapper)
    OC-->>UI: 201 Created
    UI-->>C: show bill, option to download
